        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Carroll Lynch, Nick Offerman, Richard McDonald, Maurice McDonald, Logan Sparks, Drago Sumonja\n- Works: The Drew Carey Show, The Founder, Lucky\n- Roles: Steve Carey, Twisty the Clown\n- Companies: McDonald's\n\nFacts:\n- John Carroll Lynch played Steve Carey, the title character's cross-dressing brother, on the ABC sitcom The Drew Carey Show.\n- John Carroll Lynch also played Twisty the Clown on television.\n- In The Founder, Nick Offerman and John Carroll Lynch co-starred as McDonald's founders Richard McDonald and Maurice McDonald.\n- Lucky is a 2017 American drama film directed by John Carroll Lynch.\n- Lucky was written by Logan Sparks and Drago Sumonja.",
